        <p>-- FIRST-CLASS MACHINES, BY ALL THE POPULAR MAKERS, CL UDING : Royal Enfield, Budge-Whitworth, Elswick, New Howe. Beeston and Coventry Hurnbers, Osmonds, Swifts, Waverlay Le., &amp;.c. Cash prices for New Machines REI and upvrarda. Easy terms of payment, from 10s. per month. Secondhand Machines from £5. Write at once for catalogue, which gives a choice of FOUR DIFFERENT WAYS of purchasing a Bicycle.</p>
