        <p>VVANTED, experiencyl Nurse for Waterloo and south port wages £23, Also good Cook and Housemaid Waitress (for same house) ; £lB to 221 ; and superior General, for Manchester ; two in family —Alent Mrs. WiNmon. 133, South-road, Waterloo, Liverpool, late of Southport.</p>
        <p>HERB BEER, Tobacc,o, Sweets, &amp;c., Business, £l5 Stock and Fixtures. &amp;c best shop on the road ; a nice house good liviog,-336, T. HOWARD-ST„ Liverpool.</p>
