        <p>Take VENO'S LIGHTNING COUQH CURE. It Stops an ordinary cough in one night, and cursq chronic coughs, bronchitis, asthma, catarrah, influfnza, and whooping cough rapidly. Its vast superiority over the different emulsions and ordinary cough mixtures cannot be esti- mated. Is has saved thousands of lives after they have been turned out of hospitals. It is a new scientific remedy endirsed by medical men. Ask for Vforo's LIGHTNING COUGFI CURE, and see that you get it, price 111. and 2s. 9.1. per bottle (crtpvright). Sold by fol- lowing chemists :—AsnTorr, Kriownms, Warcington ; WaLLBRIDGE, St. ri,ylens ; PEARE, Eirlestown and Ntswtou ; FOGGITT, WithlCS ; WESTON, Runcorn ; and all chemiits.</p>
