        <p>COCKL4'S ANTIBILIOUS PILLS,</p>
        <p>and we find that the desired end may be obtained without scales and weights, or little mysterious compartments, and enchanted bottles with crystal stoppers. Others might be used, but</p>
        <p>, COCKLE'S PILLS, as tested by many thousands of persons, and found to answer their purposes so well, may be set down as the best.—Observer.</p>
        <p>FREE cROM MERCURY.</p>
      </div>
